<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
<<LookAt 1 7>>
Zoran: Ah... Your majesty. I see you got my urgent message... 
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: *But you're as late as ever* <br> *Cough* *Cough*
Zoran:...

<<Act Zoran zoranSurprise 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: The situation is dire...
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: The [normalWave]FILTHY[/normalWave] peasantry disagree with you as their new monarch.
Zoran: And thus they have risen in rebelion...

<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Unlike me, your ever-loyal servant.
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Of course, I warned the late king this might happen...
Zoran: No matter, we can't stand here lamenting poor decisions of the past. 



Zoran: As I was saying...
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Before you my princess is a battle map.
<<Scene #000000 0.35>>
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 -10.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Do you see those little figurines of buildings? Yes? Good.
<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: they represent real life towns, castles and structures of interest in your kingdom.


<<LookAt 2 4>>
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Take this one for instance, the dispicable rabble have comandeered it as their own.

<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Thankfully not all of your subjects are as disloyal.
<<Act Zoran zoranChill 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
Zoran: Some loyal men remain stationed in this town here.
<<LookAt 0 4>>

<<Act Zoran zoranTalk 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
<<LookAt 0 7>>
Zoran: And above it sits the number of expendable troops it has of course.
Zoran: ...
Zoran: Now all you have to do is give the order and they'll march on your comamnd.
<<Act Zoran zoranSmug 0.25 0.2 #a20404>>
<<LookAt 1 7>>
Zoran: you can do this by first <color=red><b>clicking once <sprite name="mouse_l"></b></color> on your town and then <color=red><b>click <sprite name="mouse_l"></b></color> on the enemy town.
Zoran: Try it. 
